  "goodToKnow": "Die Vorrunde is the preliminary round or group stage of a tournament: in der Vorrunde ausscheiden (to be knocked out in the group stage), which happened to defending champions Germany at the 2018 World Cup, a national shock. After the Vorrunde come the knockout rounds: Achtelfinale, Viertelfinale, Halbfinale, Finale. In the Bundesliga, the season is split into Hinrunde and Rückrunde. Plural: die Vorrunden."
